      <text y="5">Every part ships its code and runs again</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <span class="ships-brumate">With brumate, only the parts that respond to the user ship code, and each loads on its own event. The rest is HTML.</span>
    <span class="ships-hydration-text">With hydration, the browser loads the code of every part of the page and renders it again, static parts included.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
